WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:02.450
<i>Miku.</i>

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:06.870
<i>My friend. Kohinata Miku.</i>

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:10.200
<i>My childhood friend.
 I've known her for years.</i>

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:15.110
<i>Sometimes we get into fights, 
but we always make up.</i>

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:22.630
<i>I thought that things
 would always be that way.</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:26.070
<i>But...</i>

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:33.300
<i>My sunshine was taken from me.</i>

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:36.370
<i>And the hand that was to take hers</i>

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:40.890
<i>found a terrible conclusion instead...</i>

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:48.330
<i>On that day, everything 
I cared for was taken from me.</i>

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.890
Don't go!

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:50.960
Don't leave me!

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.020
Miku!

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:39.340
Okay, it's all set!

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:41.470
Did you know?

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:45.740
The instant stuff is pretty good these days.

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:51.560
I guess you get hungry even 
when you don't move, huh?

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:56.930
It means that, right now, you're alive.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.810
Thank you for the food.

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:02.500
It was pretty good, huh?

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.160
I'm surprised, though.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:09.000
I never thought you'd be under house 
arrest for breaking the rules.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.930
I lost something important. 
It was taken from me.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:16.170
I didn't know what to do.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:19.000
So I just wanted to run...

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:22.970
The next thing I knew, I was here.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.340
I see.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:30.980
Well, I do know a thing 
or two about running.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.950
No, it's because you're my dad.

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:40.180
Why don't you tell me what's on your mind,

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:42.110
instead of keeping it to yourself?

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:49.870
Don't go!

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:50.990
Don't leave me!

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:53.290
Miku!

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:00.750
Tachibana!

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:03.040
M-Miku!

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:07.500
The foulness of humanity pleases me.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:12.890
Even after a million nights, 
you still fill the Earth.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:18.190
Stop it! You're not supposed 
to talk like that!

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:23.200
All that remains is that terrible moon...

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:28.760
Miku?

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:30.900
Kohinata?

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.750
That thing she's wearing...

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.870
Is it what we saw before?

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:41.180
And... activate seal.

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:47.000
Miku? Let's go back together—

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:51.800
Senpai!

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:54.270
Why? Tsubasa-san?

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:57.210
This is for this country's future.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:06.060
She's just using a wide-area attack...

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:08.230
It's not like her.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.660
<b>Chaos Shadow Weave</b>

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:14.280
We can't move!

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:15.870
Tsubasa-san!

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:19.500
I am the protector of this country!

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.800
Senpai!

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:31.020
So the Kazanari Organization 
really was behind everything.

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:33.850
I don't want to believe it.

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:36.380
But I still believe in her...

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:41.470
She's not the type to be 
able to betray someone.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:43.460
I don't doubt her, either!

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:46.310
She's one of us!

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:49.250
It was probably that evil eye...

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.040
<b>Summons
Come to the Command Center
Immediately</b>

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.140
<i>Just me?</i>

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:08.120
Kohinata?

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:13.190
No... This is the power of a god, 
which our nation deserves!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:19.380
Mental control via a direct feedback 
system will soon be complete!

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:24.310
That will be the birth of a next-generation 
power to protect our country.

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:28.870
But, without Sakurai, how did you 
create a new Symphogear?

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:34.590
It is not a Symphogear. It is the 
Faust Robe of the Shenshoujin.

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:40.350
But the one who made it is long gone.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:44.980
<i>Something whispered to 
me that I had to do it,</i>

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.150
<i>and I didn't doubt it for a moment.</i>

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:54.100
<i>But was what I did really right?</i>

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:55.940
<i>I...</i>

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:56.960
Tsubasa!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:01.780
Why didn't you finish them?

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:03.650
B-Because...

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:06.670
It is unimportant, 
but you must not hesitate.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:11.450
A weak heart like that 
will someday break you.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.400
You must become a monster 
for the sake of your nation.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.520
Songs cannot save the world!

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.040
Yes, sir.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:24.550
Did you call me?

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:27.240
Sorry for bringing you here on short notice.

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:31.490
<i>We have a new, urgent mission for you.</i>

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:35.410
Political methods and intelligence gathering

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:39.150
have given us what we need to conduct 
a raid on the Kazanari mansion.

00:07:39.530 --> 00:07:41.440
The raid will take place soon.

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:43.580
The Kazanari mansion?

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:45.690
The family you and Tsubasa belong to?

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:49.510
Yes. There's no time left.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:52.320
<i>The Japanese government has ordered
 the arrest of Kazanari Fudou</i>

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:57.530
<i>for violating the Disaster Deployment for the
 Protection of the Nation Act which he helped pass.</i>

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:01.450
<i>If necessary, you are permitted 
to use lethal force.</i>

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:03.450
Lethal force?

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:05.790
Does that go for Tsubasa, too?

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:09.700
We've decided that we can't 
let either Hibiki-san,

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:13.460
who's currently confined to quarters, 
or the underage staff, go.

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:15.400
So we decided to ask you...

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:17.660
Mission or not, I can't do this.

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:21.460
That's not what it means to put 
your heart behind your blade.

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:22.820
Right?

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:28.490
No matter what the reason is, 
it's wrong for family to kill family.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:34.130
I'll go with you to bring Tsubasa back, 
even if I have to drag her out myself!

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.040
I realized about halfway through

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:46.870
that there's no way a guy like me 
will have useful advice for you.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:49.720
You're the one who brought it up!

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.550
Yeah, but...

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:53.620
Sorry.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:58.090
I think I'm cursed.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:18.410
<b>Approved</b>

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:19.880
The gate is open.

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:24.330
I can unlock any security 
systems I have access to.

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:28.970
Find and arrest Kazanari Fudou
 and anyone with him.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.630
Alca-Noise!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.340
Leave them to me!

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:41.150
Listen, Maria-kun. The Amalgam...

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:44.460
Got it. I don't want to be 
under house arrest, either!

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:45.840
Thanks.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:50.580
If we break any more rules, S.O.N.G. 
may be driven out of Japan.

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:52.780
The engagement began right on time.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:56.190
But full authorization to use 
all abilities still isn't...

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:00.960
What's going on here?

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:09.790
Begin the raid! Find the evidence!

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.490
It's dangerous here.

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:12.590
Come this way!

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:27.410
You're a disgrace to your father!
 A dog of the UN!

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:30.080
What makes you think you 
have the right to be here?

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:32.940
I'm here to stop you, of course!

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:39.700
What?

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:46.330
Commander!

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:52.680
That's right... Yeah.

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:54.880
I'm glad I got to see you.

00:10:55.610 --> 00:11:00.190
I have a lot of questions for you, Tsubasa!

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:14.150
Is siding with Kazanari Fudou what 
you meant by protecting the people?

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.130
Yes!

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:17.520
The power of the gods is 
needed for that purpose!

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.270
You don't believe a word of that.

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:23.110
How dare you?

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:31.370
Remember! Remember your home! 
Remember your friends!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.590
Remember the reason you're you!

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:35.630
The reason I'm me?

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.410
That's right!

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:43.440
You said you'd protect the people with your
 own power, not the power of the gods!

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.620
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:51.970
People are weak!

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:56.510
And because they're weak, they must 
be protected by a strong power!

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:11.990
You'll protect them because 
they're weak? How arrogant.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.240
What?

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:19.120
It's as if you can't keep yourself going 
unless you're protecting someone.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:27.590
When did you start protecting 
yourself instead of others?

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:37.830
Protecting the weak isn't 
a good enough reason...

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:42.820
Then why did I...

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:47.940
keep talking about being 
a protector, like a fool.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:52.370
I don't know! I don't know!

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:26.660
You're mine!

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:41.460
Victory is fleeting.

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:03.140
If you'd truly meant to kill me, perhaps...

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:06.290
You continue to disappoint me, son.

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:16.320
Now that they're having those big, 
flashy fights, it's our turn!

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:18.280
What do we do?

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:22.620
We take control of the 
power of the gods ourselves.

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:26.470
Kazanari Fudou abandoned 
us without a thought.

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:29.340
He needs to be punished.

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:34.140
Okay, now the direct feedback system is...

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:37.170
What?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.440
Hey, is that...

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:42.630
Elza-chan! Millaarc-chan!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.660
Let's go home, Tsubasa.

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:57.050
Everyone's waiting.

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.620
Maria!

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:06.390
Come with me, Tsubasa!

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:08.170
If you are a protector...

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:11.350
If the blood of the Kazanari lies within you!

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:13.080
I cannot...

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:18.880
I have nothing that will 
give me the power to stand...

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:22.520
Seal, activate!

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:24.360
I cannot...

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:32.490
You're a disgrace to the Kazanari!

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:35.280
A disgrace to your elders!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.450
Father!

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:55.190
So my son was here, too?

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:58.130
Why would I...

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:07.260
I didn't want anybody but me 
pretending to be your father...

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:16.460
Tsubasa... we don't protect 
people because they're weak.

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:20.810
We do it because they're worth protecting.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:24.930
Don't forget that.

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:28.790
Father!

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:33.160
So he's dead, huh?

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.300
That's what he gets for 
disobeying his father!

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:45.130
I am far too immature to know what it 
is in people that's worth protecting.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.160
But still...

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:52.630
Please listen to my song!

00:16:53.520 --> 00:17:01.330
<i>Imyuteus Ame no Habakiri tron.</i>

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:48.420
<i>As long as you share what's in your heart,
 you can overcome bonds of blood.</i>

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:55.050
<i>As they journey to the end, 
they tell me the ways of life</i>

00:17:55.050 --> 00:18:03.620
<i>Raging without a weapon (or any power at all)</i>

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:08.260
<i>But if you have a dream (hope will bloom)</i>

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:13.800
<i>No matter when, no matter where, 
it's always people who protect other people</i>

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:18.090
<i>A bladeless love taught me of true strength</i>

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:21.870
<b>Wind Circle Fire Slash
What Will You Do?</b>

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:28.360
<i>I shall protect within my heart, a warrior 
worth a thousand looking up into the sky</i>

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:23.950
He's overpowering a Gear on his own!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:24.870
At this rate...

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:27.160
You can't protect the world with songs!

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:31.080
People connecting and understanding 
each other is impossible!

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:34.630
<i>Singing a song to those who've become stars</i>

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:36.550
Why don't you understand 
that such nonsense disgraces

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:33.090
<b>Rin</b>

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:33.420
<b>Pyou</b>

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:33.710
<b>Tou</b>

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:34.050
<b>Sha</b>

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:34.380
<b>Kai</b>

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:34.750
<b>Jin</b>

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:40.800
<i>Burn, the answer must be there.
 It's your destiny to go on</i>

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:35.090
<b>Retsu</b>

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:35.420
<b>Zai</b>

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:35.800
<b>Zen</b>

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:40.340
your ancestors who shed blood and gave 
their lives to build this nation?

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:45.680
<i>Listen to the sound of 
this bird's wings flapping</i>

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:48.780
<i>Crane's Eye</i>

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:55.610
Now, die!

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:03.230
D-Did we make it in time?

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.740
<b>Ability Limit Release Approved</b>

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:11.110
Father!

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:37.110
<i>How much blood must I shed to 
save the flame of life from evil?</i>

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:34.770
The Murakumo, which I value 
as highly as my own life!

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:42.870
<i>The heavens shall guide me to the answer</i>

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:42.860
What this nation needs isn't a protector, 
but a monster to protect it!

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:46.060
I shall die and become such a monster!

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:47.890
<i>May my sword open a path</i>

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:48.120
And you, too...

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:50.330
<i>My sword...</i>

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:52.880
are such a monster!

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:57.830
That's enough, Tsubasa.

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:03.100
If I let you become a monster,
 then I will have failed my brother.

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:18.570
An earthquake?

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.360
Is this rumbling...

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:22.790
No, look!

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:29.330
What is that?

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:33.200
Yes. Yes.

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:36.320
But I'm under house arrest...

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:39.780
Understood. I'm on my way to HQ.

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:41.910
Are you going?

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.510
Yeah. I have to go.

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:48.170
Listen, Hibiki...

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:51.470
You're okay. You're just fine.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:55.770
I'm a bad dad who can't do anything for you.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:59.020
It's the one thing I can tell you.

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:04.710
The same words turned into a 
curse, for a coward like me.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:07.490
<b>First
Day
of
School</b>

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:07.500
But it's different for you, right?

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:09.470
Dad...

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:17.040
Whether something's a blessing or a 
curse is all in how you feel about it.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:18.970
A curse...

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:22.050
Yeah. You're right.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:24.610
And well, you know...

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:29.070
The kanji for "curse" and "blessing" 
look really similar, too, right?

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:31.200
They're two sides of the same coin...

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:35.810
So, you know, maybe what I'm saying is true!

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:38.260
What?

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:41.440
I'm sure by this time next year, 
everybody will be quoting me.

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:43.320
I'm sure they will!

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:48.830
Go, Hibiki!

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:50.910
Leave your mom to me!

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:54.230
Thanks, Dad!

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:56.090
The ramen was great!
